A1  - Slater, Amy
A1  - Tiggemann, Marika
Y1  - 2002//
Y2  - 2002//
N2  - Tested the components of a model proposed by Objectification Theory in a sample of adolescent girls who did and did not study classical ballet. Participant surveys examined self-objectification, body shame, appearance anxiety, and disordered eating. There was no difference between groups on self-objectification or any of its proposed consequences. For the total sample, however, the proposed model was largely supported. (SM)
